"Project: {col:projects.name}. Project manager: {col:projects.manager}. Sponsor: {col:projects.sponsor}.": "Proyek: {col:projects.name}. Manajer proyek: {col:projects.manager}. Sponsor: {col:projects.sponsor}.",
"The RACI matrix lists {col:projects.raci_n} activities. Of these, {col:projects.raci_bad} need a fix: each activity needs one person who is responsible and exactly one person who is accountable.": "Matriks RACI mencantumkan {col:projects.raci_n} kegiatan. Dari ini, {col:projects.raci_bad} perlu perbaikan: setiap kegiatan membutuhkan satu orang yang bertanggung jawab dan persis satu orang yang bertanggung jawab.",
"Everyone named in the matrix confirms their role before the kick-off. Anyone consulted is asked before a decision, and anyone informed is told after it.": "Setiap orang yang disebutkan dalam matriks mengkonfirmasi peran mereka sebelum kick-off.",
"Funding approval request": "Permintaan persetujuan pendanaan",
"Funding approval request of {set:firm}, dated {today}.": "Permintaan persetujuan pendanaan dari {set:firm}, tanggal {today}.",
"Project: {col:funding.project}. Purpose: {col:funding.purpose}. Approver: {col:funding.approver}.": "Proyek: {col:funding.project}. Tujuan: {col:funding.purpose}. Penyetujui: {col:funding.approver}.",
"We ask for {col:funding.requested} and ask you to approve it under the budget code {col:funding.budget_code}. The request was made on {col:funding.requested_on}.": "Kami meminta {col:funding.requested} dan meminta Anda untuk menyetujuinya di bawah kode anggaran {col:funding.budget_code}.",
"Current state: {col:funding.state}. Amount approved so far: {col:funding.approved}. Amount not approved: {col:funding.short}.": "Status saat ini: {col:funding.state}. jumlah yang disetujui sejauh ini: {col:funding.approved}. jumlah yang tidak disetujui: {col:funding.short}.",
"Please approve the amount, or tell us what you need to change, so that the finance partner can open the budget.": "Silakan approve jumlahnya, atau beritahu kami apa yang perlu Anda ubah, sehingga mitra keuangan dapat membuka anggaran.",
"Portfolio overview line for the leadership team": "Garis gambaran portofolio untuk tim kepemimpinan",
"Portfolio overview of {set:firm}, dated {today}.": "Ringkasan portofolio dari {set:firm}, tanggal {today}.",
"Project: {col:projects.name} for {col:projects.client}. Type: {col:projects.type}. Method: {col:projects.method}. Priority: {col:projects.priority}. Stage: {col:projects.stage}.": "Proyek: {col:projects.name} untuk {col:projects.client}. Jenis: {col:projects.type}. Metode: {col:projects.method}. Prioritas: {col:projects.priority}. Tahap: {col:projects.stage}.",
"Status: {col:projects.status}. Health: {col:projects.health}. Progress: {col:projects.pct_done}. The budget is {col:projects.budget}, which is {col:projects.share} of the portfolio budget.": "Status: {col:projects.status}. Kesehatan: {col:projects.health}. Kemajuan: {col:projects.pct_done}. Anggaran adalah {col:projects.budget}, yang adalah {col:projects.share} dari anggaran portofolio.",
"The baseline end is {col:projects.end} and the forecast end is {col:projects.forecast_end}. Days late: {col:projects.days_late}. Schedule: {col:projects.schedule}.": "Akhir garis dasar adalah {col:projects.end} dan akhir perkiraan adalah {col:projects.forecast_end}. Hari terlambat: {col:projects.days_late}. Jadwal: {col:projects.schedule}.",
"The leadership team is asked to note the position and to decide on any project that shows red health or a late end date.": "Tim kepemimpinan diminta untuk mencatat posisi dan untuk memutuskan pada setiap proyek yang menunjukkan kesehatan merah atau tanggal akhir yang terlambat.",
"Managing director": "Direktur Utama",
"Kick-off invitation and agenda": "Undangan awal dan agenda",
"Kick-off invitation from {set:firm}, dated {today}.": "Undangan kick-off dari {set:firm}, tanggal {today}.",
"Project: {col:projects.name}. Client: {col:projects.client}. Sponsor: {col:projects.sponsor}. Project manager: {col:projects.manager}.": "Proyek: {col:projects.name}. Klien: {col:projects.client}. Sponsor: {col:projects.sponsor}. Manajer proyek: {col:projects.manager}.",
"You are invited to the kick-off of the project, which starts on {col:projects.start}. The project runs until {col:projects.end}.": "Anda diundang untuk memulai proyek, yang dimulai pada {col:projects.start}.",
"Agenda: 1. Purpose and objectives from the charter. 2. Scope, what is in and what is out. 3. Roles, using the RACI matrix. 4. Plan, milestones and the budget of {col:projects.budget}. 5. Risks and assumptions. 6. How we report and decide. 7. Next steps.": "Agenda: 1. Tujuan dan tujuan dari piagam. 2. Lingkup, apa yang masuk dan apa yang keluar. 3. Peran, menggunakan matriks RACI. 4. Rencana, tonggak dan anggaran {col:projects.budget}. 5. Risiko dan asumsi. 6. Bagaimana kita melaporkan dan memutuskan. 7. Langkah selanjutnya.",
"Please confirm that you will attend and send us anything you want on the agenda.": "Mohon konfirmasi bahwa Anda akan hadir dan kirimkan kami apa pun yang Anda inginkan dalam agenda.",
"Project start-up confirmation to the client": "Konfirmasi memulai proyek kepada klien",
"Project start-up confirmation from {set:firm}, dated {today}.": "Konfirmasi memulai proyek dari {set:firm}, tanggal {today}.",
"To {col:projects.contact}, {col:projects.client}.": "Untuk {col:projects.contact}, {col:projects.client}.",
"We confirm that the project {col:projects.name} is approved. Your sponsor is {col:projects.sponsor} and our project manager is {col:projects.manager}.": "Kami mengkonfirmasi bahwa proyek {col:projects.name} disetujui. Sponsor Anda adalah {col:projects.sponsor} dan manajer proyek kami adalah {col:projects.manager}.",
"The start date is {col:projects.start} and the planned end date is {col:projects.end}. The budget is {col:projects.budget}.": "Tanggal awal adalah {col:projects.start} dan tanggal akhir yang direncanakan adalah {col:projects.end}.",
"In the first two weeks we will hold a scope workshop and agree the charter and the plan with you. Please name the people from your side who will take part.": "Dalam dua minggu pertama, kami akan mengadakan lokakarya ruang lingkup dan menyetujui piagam dan rencana dengan Anda.",
